1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,242
It gets worse on hot, dry days, when stomata close, internal carbon dioxide falls and oxygen builds up.

2
00:00:08,242 --> 00:00:13,372
A wheat field on a hot afternoon can lose about a quarter of the carbon it fixes.

3
00:00:13,372 --> 00:00:15,468
Some plants have found a way round it.

